{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e301f689-2d3f-8ec4-a9f0-829f125d95cd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:58:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:55:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I think I need to report a pothole, maybe? It's sort of a bad one. It just blew my tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:55:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Okay, I can take that down. Where is the pothole, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 284 Callender Avenue, I think that's the number, there's a house right there. It's in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two eighty-four Callender Avenue. Is it in the road itself, or by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's sort of right in the bike lane. Maybe a foot or two from the curb. I think the rain yesterday made it worse, because I drove this way Wednesday and I didn't hit anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so in the bike lane in front of 284 Callender. And that was the soaker that ended yesterday, Thursday, so that fits. What happened to the car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:56:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The tire blew, I think right away, and the rim is maybe bent. I sort of limped it up the road. I'm actually stopped right now on the Newport Bridge approach, in the car, waiting for a tow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodness, are you somewhere safe? Are you out of the traffic lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I think so. I'm on the shoulder, flashers on. It's fine. I'm just calling while I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Alright, let me read this back. Large pothole in the bike lane at 284 Callender Avenue, blew a tire, rim looks bent. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's right. I think that's everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a callback number in case someone needs to reach you about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Samir Nguyen. N-G-U-Y-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Nguyen. I've got it logged for the road crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know how long repairs usually take? Like, maybe a few days, or sort of weeks? I'm just wondering."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:58:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a pothole gets looked at within a few days, and patching often follows soon after. Cold, wet weather can stretch it a bit, so call it somewhere between a few days and a couple of weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:58:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I think that makes sense. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:58:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care out there, and I hope the tow gets to you quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
